{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "בחדש הראשון", :translit "b'chodesh ha-rishon", :gloss "In the first month"} {:he "פרה אדומה", :translit "parah adumah", :gloss "red heifer"} {:he "מכפר", :translit "m'chapeir", :gloss "atones"} {:he "מיתת צדיקים מכפרת", :translit "mitat tzadikim m'chaperet", :gloss "death of the righteous atones"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "פרה אדומה", :b "מכפר"}], :frame {:text "The Mishnah states that just as the red heifer (parah adumah) atones, so the death of the righteous atones (Moed Katan 28a). Ba'al HaTurim applies this to Miriam's death reported in Numbers 20:1. The Talmud records a dispute about when the red heifer was burned; the first day of Nissan is cited as an occasion for burning (Pesachim 6a). By juxtaposing Miriam's death in 'the first month' to the preceding section of the red heifer, Ba'al HaTurim links the two as parallel forms of atonement.", :sources ["Moed Katan 28a" "Pesachim 6a"]}} {:quotes [{:he "ותמת שם מרים ותקבר שם", :translit "va-tamat sham miryam va-tikaver sham", :gloss "And Miriam died there and was buried there"} {:he "שם", :translit "sham", :gloss "there"} {:he "מכפר", :translit "m'chapeir", :gloss "atones"} {:he "אסור בהנאה", :translit "asur b'hanah", :gloss "forbidden for benefit"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "שם", :b "מכפר"} {:kind :gematria, :a "שם", :b "אסור בהנאה"}], :frame {:text "The Mishnah states that just as the red heifer atones, so the death of the righteous atones (Moed Katan 28a). Ba'al HaTurim sees the doubled word שם ('there') in Numbers 20:1 — 'she died there and was buried there' — as encoding two properties: the gematria of שם equals מכפר ('atones'), reinforcing that Miriam's death atones, and also equals אסור בהנאה ('forbidden for benefit'), linking Miriam to the red heifer, whose ashes render impure those who handle them yet purify the defiled (Numbers 19).", :sources ["Moed Katan 28a" "Numbers 19"]}}], :arithmetic [{:a-value 341, :b-value 340, :lens :standard, :equal? false, :kind :gematria, :b "מכפר", :by :selah, :colel? true, :a "פרה אדומה"} {:kind :gematria, :a "שם", :a-value 340, :b "מכפר", :b-value 340, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? true} {:kind :gematria, :a "שם", :a-value 340, :b "אסור בהנאה", :b-value 330, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false}], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:30:08.989154770Z", :model "glm-5.2"}